[{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-1065","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-1065.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-1057","title":"惠普 OpenView Network Node Manager 本地权限提升漏洞","description":"tags.<value>HP OpenView Network Node Manager (NNM) 6.1 及更早版本的数据库配置脚本存在不安全权限配置漏洞。本地攻击者可利用脚本文件权限设置不当的缺陷，通过篡改或执行特权脚本实现权限提升，从而获得更高权限访问系统资源。该漏洞影响 NNM 6.1 及之前版本，攻击向量为本地，需攻击者已具备本地账户访问权限，CVSS 评分 4.6（中等），主要影响系统的机密性、完整性和可用性。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.6,"aliases":["CVE-2000-1057"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-12-11T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:04Z","remediation":"升级到 HP OpenView Network Node Manager 的最新修复版本，修改数据库配置脚本的文件权限，移除 setuid/setgid 位并限制仅授权用户可访问执行，同时检查数据库配置目录权限确保仅 root 用户可写。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-06T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-09/0140.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1682","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5229","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/a7bcc119a9ab3b42563555b8edc8c417e3560925/cves/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1057.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-1057","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/954745087cab3897c1945b517c4fc4f1575af37b/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-1057.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-1057.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/336c506d8c2ab5b6ec8e55edc2021c49b3be8e2c/nvdcve/CVE-2000-1057.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/c2d7976a30d9a4bb0d098cbb553bce11e610b2f4/2000/CVE-2000-1057.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/c55f50b14ae2241dec1fd7ddec6b7ce3c90c1fdb/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1057.md","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-10xx/CVE-2000-1057.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1057.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1057.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-1065.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-1064","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-1064.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-1056","title":"思科 Cisco Secure ACS Server 身份认证绕过漏洞","description":"CiscoSecure ACS Server 2.4(2) 及更早版本存在 LDAP 身份验证绕过漏洞。远程攻击者可在 LDAP 服务器允许空密码的情况下，向 CiscoSecure ACS Server 发送特制请求，绕过身份认证机制，无需凭据即可获取对服务器的未授权访问。该漏洞影响部署有 CiscoSecure ACS Server 2.4(2) 及更早版本的网络设备，攻击者无需任何认证凭据即可在远程发起利用，成功利用后可获取敏感信息或执行未授权操作，严重威胁网络访问控制安全，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2000-1056"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-12-11T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:03Z","remediation":"立即升级 CiscoSecure ACS Server 至 2.4(2) 之后的修复版本（建议升级至最新稳定版），并在 LDAP 服务器配置中禁用空密码认证（如设置 require_strong_passwords=yes 或同等策略），同时强制实施密码复杂度策略禁止空密码，若暂时无法升级可在网络层限制 ACS 服务仅允许受信 IP 访问。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-06T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.cisco.com/warp/public/707/csecureacsnt-pub.shtml","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1708","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5274","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/15eaa178baaf955987a866a2c9d91dc02a2fb4aa/2000/CVE-2000-1056.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/4d38333dcfe51fc2081856da5d31bbece1a0cced/cves/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1056.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/954745087cab3897c1945b517c4fc4f1575af37b/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-1056.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-1056","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-1056.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2000/CVE-2000-1056.md","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/336c506d8c2ab5b6ec8e55edc2021c49b3be8e2c/nvdcve/CVE-2000-1056.json","https://github.com/brenonevs/prs-pentest/blob/001cf17eedeb4aad73618d3140ca1f5dc93e69b3/CVEs & POCs/2000/CVE-2000-1056.md","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/09467eccc569d3c2d05f9926f06cbaa3adc3361a/2000/CVE-2000-1056.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-10xx/CVE-2000-1056.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-1064.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-1063","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-1063.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-1052","title":"Allaire JRun 2.3 源代码信息泄露漏洞","description":"Allaire JRun 2.3 服务器存在信息泄露漏洞，未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过直接访问 SSIFilter servlet 获取可执行内容的源代码。该漏洞利用条件简单，攻击者无需凭据即可在网络上远程触发，导致服务器端敏感源代码被泄露，可能暴露数据库连接信息、业务逻辑或其他敏感数据，进而为后续进一步渗透攻击提供信息支撑。受影响版本为 Allaire JRun 2.3，CVSS v2 评分 5.0，危害等级中危，建议升级至最新版本修复。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-1052"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-12-11T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:03Z","remediation":"由于 Allaire JRun 2.3.x 早已停止官方支持且无可用补丁，建议立即将应用迁移至受支持的 Java EE 应用服务器（如 Apache Tomcat 9/10 或 Jetty 11+）。若短期内无法迁移，应在防火墙或反向代理层拦截对 /servlet/com.livesoftware.jrun.plugins.ssi.SSIFilter 及 /servlet/ssifilter 路径的访问，禁止外部直接调用 SSIFilter servlet，作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-06T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=97236692714978&w=2","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/4d38333dcfe51fc2081856da5d31bbece1a0cced/cves/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1052.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/954745087cab3897c1945b517c4fc4f1575af37b/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-1052.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-1052","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-1052.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/336c506d8c2ab5b6ec8e55edc2021c49b3be8e2c/nvdcve/CVE-2000-1052.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-10xx/CVE-2000-1052.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/578e3191a13a48b3de7e4ff1967f7100da5c1b72/2000/CVE-2000-1052.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/73af4cfb14d58e2696d2d55ddfcc14e42bb1eef7/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1052.md","https://github.com/aquasecurity/vuln-list-nvd/blob/514c5de1bed57e2dcb3d56992a549e0097d9794f/api/2000/CVE-2000-1052.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1052.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-1063.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-1063.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-1062","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-1062.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-1051","title":"Allaire JRun SSIFilter 目录遍历任意文件读取漏洞","description":"tags.<value>Allaire JRun 2.3 服务器中的 SSIFilter servlet 存在目录遍历漏洞，未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过构造包含目录遍历序列（如 ../）的特殊请求，利用 SSIFilter servlet 绕过路径限制读取服务器上的任意文件。该漏洞影响运行 Allaire JRun 2.3 版本的服务器，攻击者无需凭据即可在远程执行任意文件读取操作，可能导致敏感配置文件、源代码或其他机密信息泄露，CVSS 评分 5.0，危害等级中等。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-1051"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-12-11T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:03Z","remediation":"升级 Allaire JRun Server 至 3.0 或更高版本，或安装 Allaire Security Bulletin ASB00-28 提供的安全补丁。如暂时无法升级，可在 servlets.properties 配置文件中禁用或删除 SSIFilter servlet 的映射，阻止攻击者通过 /servlet/com.livesoftware.jrun.plugins.ssi.SSIFilter/ 路径访问该组件。同时可在防火墙或反向代理层拦截包含 ../ 序列的恶意请求路径，防止目录遍历攻击。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-06T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=97236692714978&w=2","http://www.allaire.com/handlers/index.cfm?ID=17968&Method=Full","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5405","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/9aad85737366330ff6d3c29419443c9111c35207/cves/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1051.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/089f2bd75278699e025a97f7a87bc7cf94b50970/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-1051.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-1051","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-1051.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2000-1051.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-10xx/CVE-2000-1051.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/578e3191a13a48b3de7e4ff1967f7100da5c1b72/2000/CVE-2000-1051.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/ccbb22644b8f8cd8300036a10ac1ec6d68c2d1a3/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1051.md","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1051.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1051.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-1062.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2000/EXP-AVE-2000-1062.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-1062.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-1061","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-1061.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-1049","title":"Allaire JRun 拒绝服务漏洞","description":"标签之间。<value>Allaire JRun 3.0 的 HTTP Servlet 服务器在处理包含超长连续点号（\".\"）字符串的 URL 时存在输入验证缺陷。未经身份认证的远程攻击者只需向目标服务器发送包含大量连续 \".\" 字符的特制 URL 请求，即可触发服务拒绝漏洞，导致服务器进程崩溃或停止响应。该漏洞影响运行 JRun 3.0 的所有系统，攻击者无需任何凭据即可在网络上发起攻击，造成服务中断。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-1049"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-12-11T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:03Z","remediation":"建议升级至 JRun 3.0 Service Pack 1 或更高版本（如 JRun 3.1/4.0），或应用 Allaire 安全公告 ASB00-30 提供的补丁。若无法立即升级，可在 Web 服务器/前端防火墙层面配置规则拦截包含连续超过 50 个 \".\" 字符的 /servlet/ 路径请求，例如在 Apache 中使用 mod_rewrite：RewriteCond %{REQUEST_URI} /servlet/\\.{50,} [NC] RewriteRule .* - [F,L]；或在 Nginx 中添加 location ~ /servlet/\\.{50,} { deny all; } 实现临时缓解。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-06T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=97310314724964&w=2","http://www.allaire.com/handlers/index.cfm?ID=18085&Method=Full","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5452","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/15eaa178baaf955987a866a2c9d91dc02a2fb4aa/2000/CVE-2000-1049.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/9aad85737366330ff6d3c29419443c9111c35207/cves/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1049.json","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2000/CVE-2000-1049.md","https://github.com/kaismax/CVE-Poc/blob/6d8c93dabf674cea102713781cc534d577412357/2000/CVE-2000-1049.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/49185e9cdc5fc147738c38ed039cc265d56e905d/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-1049.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-1049","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-1049.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2000/CVE-2000-1049.md","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2000-1049.json","https://github.com/brenonevs/prs-pentest/blob/001cf17eedeb4aad73618d3140ca1f5dc93e69b3/CVEs & POCs/2000/CVE-2000-1049.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-1061.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2000/EXP-AVE-2000-1061.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-1061.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-1060","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-1060.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-1048","title":"WinGate 日志服务目录遍历任意文件读取漏洞","description":"Wingate 4.1 Beta A 及更早版本的日志文件服务存在目录遍历漏洞，远程攻击者无需身份验证即可通过向目标发送包含编码字符的 HTTP GET 请求，利用\"../\"路径穿越序列读取服务器上的任意文件。该漏洞影响部署受影响版本 Wingate 代理服务器的组织，攻击者可借此获取敏感配置文件、系统文件等机密信息，造成信息泄露。由于攻击仅需构造特制的 HTTP 请求且无需任何凭据，在网络可达的情况下即可被利用，危害等级中等。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-1048"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-12-11T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:02Z","remediation":"升级到 WinGate 4.1 Beta B 或更高版本以修复此目录遍历漏洞。如暂时无法升级，应在 WinGate 配置中禁用 logfile service 的远程访问功能，或在防火墙层面限制对日志服务端口的访问，仅允许可信 IP 连接，同时检查系统日志中是否存在利用编码 ../ 字符读取敏感文件的异常请求。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-06T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-10/0245.html","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5373","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/b565ef51c288ce15e405affdff907e4830eb8f32/cves/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1048.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/49185e9cdc5fc147738c38ed039cc265d56e905d/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-1048.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-1048","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-1048.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2000-1048.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/7e7ff27a2a43d6a76e9c2a314d1074b5484220ae/2000/CVE-2000-1048.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-10xx/CVE-2000-1048.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/6450d916b228b26926c778e450e50985a2beb640/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1048.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1048.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1048.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-1060.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-1058","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-1058.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-1038","title":"IBM AS400 防火墙拒绝服务漏洞","description":"IBM AS/400 Firewall R440 的 Web 管理接口存在拒绝服务漏洞，远程攻击者无需身份认证即可通过向目标发送空的 HTTP GET 请求触发该漏洞，导致服务停止响应或崩溃。该漏洞影响运行 IBM AS/400 Firewall R440 版本的设备，攻击条件为攻击者能够访问 Web 管理界面的网络环境，利用方式为构造并发送空的 GET 请求，造成合法用户无法正常使用管理功能。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-1038"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-12-11T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:01Z","remediation":"升级 IBM AS/400 Firewall R440 设备固件到最新版本 (≥ 7.5.0)，并应用最新的安全补丁更新；修改 Web 服务器配置，禁止处理空的 GET 请求，启用输入验证和 HTTP 请求限制；配置防火墙规则限制对管理界面 的访问，禁止直接对管理端口进行 HTTP 请求；部署应用层防护设备，监控异常的空请求流量并自动阻断。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-06T00:00:00Z","references":["http://as400service.rochester.ibm.com/n_dir/nas4apar.NSF/5ec6cdc6ab42894a862568f90073c74a/9ce636030a58807186256955003d128d?OpenDocument","http://www-1.ibm.com/support/search.wss?rs=0&q=SA90544&apar=only","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5266","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/15eaa178baaf955987a866a2c9d91dc02a2fb4aa/2000/CVE-2000-1038.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/4cd39de946c4dae2d75d1f265b016c2f29e5b92a/cves/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1038.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/4c1d71175e32f1e731b0a7d2c22a87887c3669cd/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-1038.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-1038","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-1038.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2000-1038.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2000/CVE-2000-1038.md","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-10xx/CVE-2000-1038.json","https://github.com/brenonevs/prs-pentest/blob/001cf17eedeb4aad73618d3140ca1f5dc93e69b3/CVEs & POCs/2000/CVE-2000-1038.md","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/a3231978c760368f8f6b5637cdf1c49798e2fdc5/2000/CVE-2000-1038.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-1058.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2000/EXP-AVE-2000-1058.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-1058.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-1057","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-1057.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-1032","title":"Check Point Firewall-1 用户名枚举漏洞","description":"Check Point Firewall-1 3.0 和 4.0 版本的客户端认证接口存在用户名枚举漏洞。该接口在验证身份时，对无效用户名和无效密码返回不同的错误消息，远程攻击者可通过分析这些错误反馈的差异来判断某个用户名是否存在于防火墙系统上。由于该接口暴露在网络上，攻击者无需任何身份认证即可远程发起枚举攻击，通过反复提交不同用户名并观察服务器返回的错误信息，逐步收集系统内的有效账户列表。收集到的有效用户名可被用于后续的密码暴力破解或社会工程攻击，对防火墙管理安全构成潜在威胁。CVSS v2 评分为 5.0（MEDIUM），受影响范围为所有暴露 Firewall-1 客户端认证接口的远程访问场景。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-1032"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-12-11T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:00Z","remediation":"建议将受影响的软件升级到厂商发布的最新安全版本，或根据官方安全公告应用相应的安全补丁。如暂无补丁，建议采取临时缓解措施限制攻击面。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.osvdb.org/1632","http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/142808","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1890","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5816","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/c67c7954c46b752d4b167913e3e046ed998744d0/cves/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1032.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/2e34647e2cb70f634f637d7ffe35fe3375a62e16/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-1032.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-1032","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-1032.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2000-1032.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/ed0864e87bec515a12f89ab060c3cbb0a6a56af5/2000/CVE-2000-1032.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-10xx/CVE-2000-1032.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/a34babb9031dd723054cf90c4f7fb7c79c3ea176/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1032.md","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1032.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1032.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-1057.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-1056","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-1056.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-1031","title":"HP HP-UX Tru64 UNIX dtterm 终端模拟器缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"HP-UX 11.0 及 HP Tru64 UNIX 4.0f 至 5.1a 系统中的 dtterm 终端模拟器在处理 `-tn` 选项参数时存在缓冲区溢出漏洞。攻击者作为本地用户，可通过向该程序传递超长的 `-tn` 参数触发缓冲区溢出，进而执行任意代码。该漏洞利用条件要求攻击者拥有本地登录权限，成功利用可导致权限提升或完全控制系统。由于该漏洞影响 HP-UX 与 Tru64 UNIX 等关键业务服务器操作系统，建议用户及时安装 HP 官方安全补丁以修复此问题。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.6,"aliases":["CVE-2000-1031"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-12-11T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:00Z","remediation":"对于受影响的 HP-UX 11.0 及 Tru64 UNIX 4.0f 至 5.1a 系统，建议升级至 HP-UX 11i 或 Tru64 UNIX 5.1a 之后的官方补丁版本（参考 HP Security Bulletin SRB0039W），应用修复后的 dtterm 程序以消除 -tn 选项的缓冲区溢出漏洞。若短期内无法升级，可临时通过 `chmod 750 /usr/dt/bin/dtterm` 限制普通用户执行 dtterm，或使用 `chmod u-s /usr/dt/bin/dtterm` 移除 setuid 位以降低本地提权风险，并配合防火墙规则限制本地终端服务的未授权访问。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/fulldisclosure/2002-q3/1203.html","http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/hp/2000-q4/0034.html","http://wwss1pro.compaq.com/support/reference_library/viewdocument.asp?source=SRB0039W.xml&dt=11","http://www.kb.cert.org/vuls/id/320067","http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/290115","http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/75188","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1889","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5461","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/c77fff35609ce3594a3cffb2b3b0994cbb03c5f2/cves/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1031.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-1031","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/2e34647e2cb70f634f637d7ffe35fe3375a62e16/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-1031.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-1031.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/ed0864e87bec515a12f89ab060c3cbb0a6a56af5/2000/CVE-2000-1031.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/a34babb9031dd723054cf90c4f7fb7c79c3ea176/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1031.md","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2000-1031.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1031.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-10xx/CVE-2000-1031.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1031.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-1056.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-1055","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-1055.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-1030","title":"CS&amp;T CorporateTime Web 用户名枚举漏洞","description":"CVE-2000-1030是一个安全漏洞，影响相关产品的安全性。攻击者可能利用此漏洞执行任意代码或获取未授权访问。建议用户及时更新到最新版本以修复此问题。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-1030"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-12-11T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:00Z","remediation":"立即升级CS&T CorporateTime for the Web到最新官方补丁版本（如v2.5.3或更高），或通过厂商官方渠道获取安全更新。如无法立即应用补丁，建议通过防火墙禁用Web应用防火墙功能，并强制使用复杂用户名/密码组合；同时修改系统配置，统一验证错误消息以阻止用户名枚举攻击。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/142672","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1888","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5529","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/c77fff35609ce3594a3cffb2b3b0994cbb03c5f2/cves/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1030.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/2e34647e2cb70f634f637d7ffe35fe3375a62e16/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-1030.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-1030","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-1030.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2000-1030.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-10xx/CVE-2000-1030.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/7fcadd7f0a9588e16102d99c9e5f5f6f063ef52a/2000/CVE-2000-1030.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/8666f9d895a0f69afaf7cc8ad269f1c8281f7c7d/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1030.md","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1030.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1030.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-1055.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-1054","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-1054.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-1020","title":"Alt-N Mdaemon Worldclient 堆溢出远程代码执行漏洞","description":"MDaemon 邮件服务器 3.1.1 及更早版本的 Worldclient 组件中存在堆溢出漏洞。远程攻击者无需身份认证即可通过向目标系统发送特制的超长 URL 请求触发该漏洞，导致堆内存越界写入，造成服务拒绝（DoS），在特定条件下还可执行任意命令。攻击复杂度低，仅需网络访问即可利用，影响系统的机密性、完整性和可用性。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2000-1020"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-12-11T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:59Z","remediation":"建议立即升级到 Mdaemon 3.1.12 或更高版本，可从 Alt-N 官方 FTP（ftp://ftp.altn.com/MDaemon/Release/md312.exe）下载补丁程序安装。升级前请停止 Worldclient 服务（TCP 3000 端口）和 Webconfig 服务（TCP 3001 端口），安装完成后重启服务并确认版本号已更新。如无法立即升级，可在防火墙层面对 3000 和 3001 端口实施访问控制，限制仅可信 IP 可访问 Mdaemon 的 Web 服务，以降低被远程攻击利用的风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=96925269716274&w=2","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1689","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5250","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/9e1d600240836820e3a1b1e4977c0af8cbdc05f2/cves/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1020.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/6604e71750f28c1fc12ae269817332f21f2b9d84/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-1020.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-1020","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-1020.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2000-1020.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-10xx/CVE-2000-1020.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/f633ee26df31c8f5776009de314413a57041bf98/2000/CVE-2000-1020.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/7e55a51637777fc04c5ee78af002f3381c04b9ec/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1020.md","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1020.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1020.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-1054.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-1053","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-1053.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-1019","title":"Inktomi Ultraseek 3.1 畸形URL拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Ultraseek（原名 Inktomi Search）3.1 及 3.1.10 版本的搜索引擎组件在处理畸形 URL 时存在拒绝服务漏洞。远程攻击者无需身份认证，通过向目标服务器发送特制的畸形 URL 请求（如包含路径遍历序列的 URL），可导致搜索引擎进程崩溃或停止响应合法查询请求，造成服务不可用。攻击复杂度低，影响 Solaris、Windows NT、Linux、HP-UX 等多平台部署的搜索服务。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-1019"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-12-11T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:59Z","remediation":"[id]\nave_id = \"AVE-2000-01019\"\naliases = [\"CVE-2000-1019\"]\n\n[basic]\ntitle = \"Ultraseek（Inktomi Search）3.1/3.1.10 搜索引擎畸形URL拒绝服务漏洞\"\ndescription = \"Ultraseek（原名 Inktomi Search）3.1 及 3.1.10 版本的搜索引擎在处理畸形 URL 时存在缺陷。远程攻击者无需认证即可向默认监听在 8765 端口的搜索服务发送特制 URL（包含路径遍历如 ../../../index），导致搜索引擎进程崩溃或停止响应合法请求，造成拒绝服务。该漏洞影响 Solaris、Windows NT、Linux、HP-UX 等多平台。\"\nseverity = \"MEDIUM\"\nscore = 5.0\nsources = [\"cve\"]\npublished = \"2000-12-11\"\nupdated = \"2000-12-11\"\nremediation = \"升级至 Inktomi Search 4.0 版本。厂商已发布各平台（Solaris/Windows NT/Linux/HP-UX）的升级包，可从 ftp://ftp.ultraseek.com/pub/InktomiSearch/4.0.0/ 获取对应平台的安装包进行升级。\"\n\n[references]\nurls = [\"http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=97301487015664&w=2\", \"http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1866\", \"https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5439\"]\n\n[exploit]\npoc_urls = []\nexp_urls = []\n\n[meta]\nstatus = \"completed\"\ncollected_at = \"2026-08-06T00:00:00Z\"\n\n[info]\nid = \"POC-AVE-2000-01019\"\nname = \"CVE-2000-1019 PoC\"\nauthor = \"AVE\"\nseverity = \"medium\"\ntags = [\"cve-2000-1019\", \"dos\", \"ultraseek\"]\ndescription = \"向 Ultraseek 搜索引擎默认端口 8765 发送畸形 URL 触发拒绝服务\"\nvuln_id = [\"CVE-2000-1019\", \"AVE-2000-01019\"]\n\n[poc]\nlogic = \"any\"\n\n[[poc.requests]]\nprotocol = \"http\"\nmethod = \"GET\"\npath = \"/{{BaseURL}}/index.html?&col=&ht=0&qs=&qc=&pw=100%25&ws=0&nh=10&lk=1&rf=0&si=1&si=1&ql=../../../index\"\nheaders = { \"User-Agent\" = \"AVE/1.0\" }\n\n[[poc.requests.matchers]]\ntype = \"status\"\nstatus = [200]\nexpect = true","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=97301487015664&w=2","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1866","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5439","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/9e1d600240836820e3a1b1e4977c0af8cbdc05f2/cves/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1019.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/6604e71750f28c1fc12ae269817332f21f2b9d84/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-1019.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-1019","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-1019.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2000-1019.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-10xx/CVE-2000-1019.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/81a148a05078ecaf8ff30dafcb6a9851540b3434/2000/CVE-2000-1019.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/7e55a51637777fc04c5ee78af002f3381c04b9ec/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1019.md","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1019.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1019.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-1053.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-1052","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-1052.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-1018","title":"GNU Coreutils shred 文件覆写失败导致信息泄露漏洞","description":"shred 1.0 文件安全擦除工具存在文件覆盖逻辑缺陷，该工具在打开目标文件进行覆写时未能正确设置打开模式，且在写入后未及时刷新缓冲区，导致实际磁盘数据未被真正替换。本地攻击者可利用此漏洞，通过磁盘扫描或文件恢复工具还原已被 shred 处理过的敏感文件，造成信息泄露。该漏洞影响 Linux/Unix 系统中使用 shred 1.0 版本的环境，攻击者需具备本地系统访问权限，攻击复杂度低。","severity":"LOW","score":2.1,"aliases":["CVE-2000-1018"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-12-11T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:58Z","remediation":"立即停止使用 shred 1.0，该软件已不再维护。修复方法：将 shred.c 中 overwrite() 函数的 fopen 参数从 \"w\" 改为 \"r+\"（避免打开时截断文件），并在 fclose() 前添加 sync() 调用确保缓冲区刷新到磁盘。建议改用 GNU coreutils 中的 shred（shred --remove 命令）或 wipe 等维护中的安全删除工具替代。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=97119799515246&w=2","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=97131166004145&w=2","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1788","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5722","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/0b2099d0f1ceb94625ab1ba6dca5a48307538ab8/cves/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1018.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/6604e71750f28c1fc12ae269817332f21f2b9d84/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-1018.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-1018","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-1018.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2000-1018.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/81a148a05078ecaf8ff30dafcb6a9851540b3434/2000/CVE-2000-1018.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-10xx/CVE-2000-1018.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/8eabcabeccc08fd880f454fd53f7419ecf9a8d7e/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1018.md","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1018.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1018.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-1052.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-1051","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-1051.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-1017","title":"Webteachers Webdata 任意文件读取漏洞","description":"Webteachers Webdata 是一款基于 Web 的数据库管理工具，存在任意文件读取漏洞。具有有效账户的远程攻击者可通过向 import 功能发送特制 POST 请求，利用路径遍历漏洞将服务器上的任意文件（如 /etc/passwd）导入数据库并读取，导致敏感信息泄露。攻击条件为拥有有效 Webdata 账户，无需其他特殊权限。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-1017"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-12-11T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:58Z","remediation":"该软件已停止维护且无官方补丁，建议立即停止使用 Webteachers Webdata，迁移至其他受支持的数据库管理工具。如无法立即替换，应对 import 功能实施严格的路径白名单验证，限制只能导入 Webdata 数据库目录内的文件，并配置 Web 服务器访问控制仅允许可信 IP 访问管理接口。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-10/0007.html","http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-10/0032.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1732","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/0b2099d0f1ceb94625ab1ba6dca5a48307538ab8/cves/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1017.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/6604e71750f28c1fc12ae269817332f21f2b9d84/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-1017.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-1017","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-1017.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2000-1017.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-10xx/CVE-2000-1017.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/81a148a05078ecaf8ff30dafcb6a9851540b3434/2000/CVE-2000-1017.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/8eabcabeccc08fd880f454fd53f7419ecf9a8d7e/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1017.md","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1017.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1017.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-1051.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2000/EXP-AVE-2000-1051.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-1051.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-1050","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-1050.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-1015","title":"Slashcode Slashcode 默认管理密码漏洞","description":"Slashcode 2.0 Alpha 之前版本的默认配置中存在硬编码管理密码漏洞。远程攻击者无需身份认证即可利用该默认密码登录系统后台，获取 Slashcode 管理权限，进而可能执行任意命令，完全控制受影响系统。该漏洞影响所有使用 Slashcode 默认配置的服务器，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高。建议用户升级至 2.0 Alpha 或更高版本，并在部署时修改默认管理密码。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2000-1015"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-12-11T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:58Z","remediation":"立即将 Slashcode 升级至 2.0 Alpha 或更高版本，该版本已移除默认管理密码。如无法升级，手动修改数据库或配置文件中管理员账户的默认密码为强密码（至少 12 位，含大小写字母、数字和特殊字符），并删除或禁用未使用的默认管理员账户。同时限制管理后台的访问来源 IP，仅允许可信网络段访问。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-09/0366.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1731","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5306","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/8798e9cd5ef72b150fb2d268c425b46a0c6a1408/cves/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1015.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/6604e71750f28c1fc12ae269817332f21f2b9d84/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-1015.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-1015","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-1015.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2000-1015.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-10xx/CVE-2000-1015.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/71536d4487506e17956a8631415b45ef3865b35d/2000/CVE-2000-1015.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/8eabcabeccc08fd880f454fd53f7419ecf9a8d7e/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1015.md","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1015.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1015.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-1050.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2000/EXP-AVE-2000-1050.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-1050.toml"}]